WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:02.120
- [Kelly] I have to ask about, obviously,

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:04.240
Randy Watson and Sexual
(laughs) Chocolate.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:05.960
(audience laughs)
Was he inspired by anyone,

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:09.030
or did that just come up
out of your imagination?

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:10.100
- Not inspired by anybody.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.790
Just came up, the way those,

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:14.960
all of those characters
come together by Rick Baker,

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.260
who designed those makeups.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:19.240
He's retired now, a genius makeup artist.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:22.130
And he would put the
makeups on me in a chair,

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:24.470
and then he would start
kinda talkin' to me like,

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:26.770
when it was about 80% done,

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:28.247
and askin' me questions, like,

00:00:28.247 --> 00:00:29.090
"Hey, where you from?

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:31.270
Where you doin," and I'd
try different voices out

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:33.920
till the right voice that looks right

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:35.030
comin' outta that makeup.

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.060
And then we kinda, you kinda
make him up in the chair.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:40.580
He comes to life in the chair.

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:42.510
- It's such a, you're so gifted at it,

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:43.700
like playing all those different roles

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:45.447
in all the different movies
I love seeing you in.

00:00:45.447 --> 00:00:47.740
It's amazing, and it's gotta be fun,

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:50.110
because at least you're not
hired to do like one thing.

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:51.630
It's not monotonous, your character,

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:52.680
'cause you're playing so many things.

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:54.001
It's gotta be so exciting.

00:00:54.001 --> 00:00:57.760
- It's rewarding, but it's not fun at all,

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.438
because the process-
- Oh (laughs).

00:00:59.438 --> 00:01:00.271
(audience laughs)
- They haven't figured out

00:01:00.271 --> 00:01:01.104
how to make the process any shorter.

00:01:01.104 --> 00:01:04.643
You got, it's six hours of
putting those makeups on.

00:01:04.643 --> 00:01:05.720
- That was-
- Not a fun thing.

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:08.924
- That was (laughs)
actually my favorite answer,

00:01:08.924 --> 00:01:11.157
that anyone's ever said.

00:01:11.157 --> 00:01:12.770
"It was rewarding, but like,

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:14.330
absolutely zero fun (laughs)."

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.010
- (laughs) It's true.
- "I actually hated my life,

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.987
but it's great, I'm glad you liked it."

